window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Together at last, it appears the fate of our country lies in the hands of a girl from the wastelands, an assassin, a were-beast, a professor, an enforcer and a fallen golden boy; leaving the six of us with impossible choices to make.<br> <br> Do we delve into the past in order to understand our future?<br> <br> Do we follow the path that fate has set us? Or do we fight against the binds of destiny?<br> <br> And can we work together to destroy the forces that threaten us all or will the restraints that have always divided us, pull us apart once again?<br> <br> Because there are some looking to me to return light to the darkness. Some who believe I am the one who will save us all. Some who think I am someone special.<br> <br> But what if they are wrong?<br> <br> I am a lover of monsters, a wielder of crimson magic, the daughter of a dark magical.<br> <br> What if I'm not here to deliver a new dawn?<br> <br> What if I'm here to bring about the end?<br> <br> ***<br> <br> A why choose romantasy series with magic, romance, ruthless love interests and fated mates. Destined Dawn is the FINAL book in the Arrow Hart Academy series (book five of five). The story will complete with a happy ever after but does contains some scenes that listeners may find challenging.</p>"; 
